WEBVTT

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.950
Now matter how many times I read them, 
the tales of the Heroes are the best.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.480
Of course, the achievements of the 
historic Heroes are wonderful,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.720
but every one of their 
companions is so unique,

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.210
and that only serves to enhance 
the charm of each Hero!

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.460
That reminds me!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:31.650
I don't know anything about our 
current 999th Hero's companions!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.940
This is terrible!

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.610
As one who loves our Hero, 
I must get to know her companions!

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.920
Wow! All three of you sneezed
 at the same time!

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.940
I wonder if someone's talking about us.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.260
All three of us?

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.320
The only one who knows all three of us is...

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.740
Yu-chan!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:54.740
Me?

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:57.080
Oh, it was me, huh?

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.080
She's talking the talk! Hah!

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.130
What were you saying about us?

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:05.060
Hold on. I'll try to remember.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.460
Is that something you can 
just "try to remember"?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.040
Oh, yeah, I guess that's kinda weird!

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.770
Endro!

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.020
Therefore...

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.960
I would like to further my 
acquaintance with your companions,

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:55.240
starting with Ellenoar-sama, 
if you'd be so kind.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.950
S-Sure.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.000
What does she mean by
 "further my acquaintance"?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.500
I think she means to become better friends.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.530
So the same as usual.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:13.250
Hey, Seira-chan, what's our next class again?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.080
Next is basic magic studies.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.340
Oh, right.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.800
Mei, that's the wrong one.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.710
That's the textbook on magic history.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.220
You want the blue one, not that one.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.790
Ah, I forgot my textbook!

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.350
Here, I brought a spare. 
You can borrow this one.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:31.540
You always seem to carry spare 
textbooks with you, Seira-chan.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.780
That's because there's always at 
least one of you who forgets hers.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.900
I own two sets of every 
textbook because of that.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.990
Impressive!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:43.140
That's so like you,
 Ellenoar-sama of the Hero's party!

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:48.340
The Priest of the 18th Hero's party 
was always making preparations, as well.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.000
That's just like him!

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.000
How wonderful!

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.780
Th-Thank you.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.980
Seira-chan, eat my peppers.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.080
Seira-san, you can have my carrots.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.260
Sei-chan, give me a piece
 of your fried chicken!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.140
Okay, okay.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.680
But you both need to eat at least one each.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.830
And Fai, make sure you chew.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.010
Okay!

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.020
Impressive, Ellenoar-sama!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.420
The Priest of the 132nd Hero's party was said

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.420
to show great concern for his 
companions' health, as well.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.900
How wonderful!

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.160
Th-Thank you.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.470
Today was exhausting.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.260
P-Princess?!

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.420
What are you doing here?!

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.300
You have things strewn about everywhere.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.040
Huh? Oh... I've just been so busy...

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.040
Between practicals, homework,
 and you know, the Hero Festival,

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.350
I haven't had time to clean up.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.310
Impressive, Ellenoar-sama!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:58.320
The Priest of the 571st Hero's party also 
had quite a unique sense of aesthetics.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.640
How wonderful!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:12.700
I'd like to spend this day off furthering 
my acquaintance with Mather-sama!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.710
That's fine,

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:17.780
but the places I'm going to might not 
be very interesting to the uninitiated.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:18.500
Huh?

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.500
Over there.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.340
So this is a Cartado shop?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.500
There are so many different kinds.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.100
This one has a plentiful selection,

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.060
but there aren't many great finds here.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.140
It's more for the average customer.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.150
Hello.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:38.500
Oh, Mei-chan, welcome.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.460
Have you got anything good in?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.460
We have a few rares in stock,

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.160
but nothing I think you'd find too exciting.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.780
Got it.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.390
You're leaving already?

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.290
I was just checking up
 on their latest shipment.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.150
I don't have time to waste 
taking it easy, anyway.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:58.630
You have other plans after this?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:02.070
I'm going to visit all of 
this city's Cartado shops.

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.800
But you don't need to come if—

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.870
As expected of the top member
 of the Hero's party, Mather-sama!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:07.380
Huh?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.970
The Mage of the 36th Hero's party was also said

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.820
to be a scholar who was 
always researching Cartado.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.390
How wonderful!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.390
Sure...

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:23.330
Let's go.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:38.190
This is a bit different from 
the shops we've visited so far.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.830
This is my main destination.

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.380
It's a hardcore shop that 
draws true aficionados

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.210
and sells the rarest Cartado in town.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:00.810
I-It has a rather unsavory—
I mean, unique atmosphere.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.930
Because it's where the strong gather.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:03.610
Huh?

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:06.500
Battle.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.240
Very well.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:13.280
Battle?! No, not in a place like this!
 Especially not with such an elderly man!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.990
Don't worry. We're just showing 
each other rare Cartado.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:17.580
Huh?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.560
Ready, set...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.460
The rare Cartado "Mega Blizzard"!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.520
And it's a five-star class!

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.360
Take a good look at my Cartado!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.820
Whoa! That's the legendary 
rare "Dragon Breath"!

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:39.770
Last time, I lost to your "Imperial Feast," 
so I brought out my treasured card!

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.640
I win this round!

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:47.030
If that's what this is about, 
I have one, as well.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.340
Huh?!

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.130
Really, Princess?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:50.720
Yes!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:57.510
Come to think of it, you do have a 
mythically rare Cartado, don't you?

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.220
Yes!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.220
Mythically rare?!

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:00.640
They really do exist?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.500
That was one I received from my father,

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.280
but these are ones
 I received for self-defense.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:10.170
I have plenty more that I left in my room,
 since I can't carry them all.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.790
C-Can I come visit your place sometime?!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.040
Yes, of course.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.680
Oh, that's right. How could 
I not have realized before?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.080
Please sell me all the rare 
Cartado in this store.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:26.440
Here, please take these, Mather-sama.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.590
Huh? H-Huh?!

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:32.100
You're the Mage of the Hero's party,

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.900
so you should have lots of good Cartado.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:35.800
Here you go.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.450
Hold it!

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:46.210
If you accept that, then you're 
finished as a Cartado collector!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:52.510
That stack of Cartado is something all Cartado 
collectors would weep and drool over.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.520
However, if you accept this now,

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.720
you'll be denying all the efforts of those

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.420
who worked themselves to the bone 
to collect every one of them!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:06.060
You've opened my eyes! I was wrong!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.110
So long as you understand.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.820
There are no shortcuts on 
the path of Cartado collecting.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:11.710
You're right!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.130
Impressive, Mather-sama!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:17.250
The Mage of the 888th 
Hero's party also turned down

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:21.980
the position of Head Royal Mage and 
instead joined the Hero's party.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:24.710
That firm resolve is so wonderful!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.550
Y-Yeah.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.710
Your acquaintance with me?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:32.620
Yes!

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:36.380
I've grown quite acquainted with 
Ellenoar-sama and Mather-sama,

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.610
so you're next, Fai-sama.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.280
I'm heading out on a trip tomorrow, though.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:42.850
Can it wait until I get back?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.300
A trip? How wonderful!

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.660
The Warrior of the 337th 
Hero's party was also said

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:51.980
to go on short trips with his 
companions to deepen their bonds.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:54.330
Please allow me to accompany you.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:57.490
Uh... Okay, why don't we go together?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:09:59.760
Yes!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.000
Roll 7

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.400
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.300
I grew up in the woods,

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.530
so I occasionally go on trips like 
this to recall my wild instincts.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.160
I-I see.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:23.020
The Warrior of the 674th Hero's party 
was also said to treasure his homeland.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.270
How wonderful!

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.420
But where is your luggage, Fai-sama?

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.270
I don't bring any luggage.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.120
Huh?

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.740
Because I'm traveling to recall my wild side!

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.360
Is that so?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.540
Well, let's go!

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.030
Huh?!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.530
Huh?!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.040
Yahoo! What a great view!

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.900
I-I-I-I see.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:49.610
The Warrior of the 70th 
Hero's party was also said

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:53.020
to love high places and 
looking down at his enemies.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.800
H-How wonderful!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.440
Here!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.050
Huh?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.120
I-I see.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:08.320
The Warrior of the 92nd Hero's 
party would also weave vines to...

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.650
This is next.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.840
Yahoo!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.460
Fai-sama, a river! A river!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.130
All right! A river!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:17.990
Huh?!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.430
Yahoo!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:25.150
I-I'm not a very good swimmer.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.250
I'll drown!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.870
Then hold on to me!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.990
It's fun being wild!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:40.760
Y-Yes, it is.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:46.620
The Warrior of the 927th Hero's party
 was also said to fight while riding dolphins.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.420
V-Very impressive, Fai-sama.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.560
How wonderful.

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:53.590
So with that, I believe it's about 
time for me to be heading back.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.690
We only just got started, though.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.570
No, no, we've furthered 
our acquaintance plenty.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.060
I know you very well now, Fai-sama.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.840
Yeah? Okay, then! Later!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.650
<i>Now that I think about it, 
I don't know the way home.</i>

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:18.850
<i>And I told my Knights not to come,
 so I'm truly alone...</i>

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:22.380
<i>And I'd have to repeat such acrobatics 
to go back the way I came,</i>

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.840
<i>only to drown when I reach the river.</i>

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.850
Wh-Wha—

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.140
Oh, you're back?

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:38.090
I can't make it back on my own!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.560
I know it's an inconvenience,

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:42.400
but could you escort me back 
to the entrance of the jungle?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.860
Yeah, sure thing!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.620
Thank you so much!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.670
But I have stuff to do tomorrow, 
so it'll be after that.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:50.250
Huh?!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.500
If you wait for me here,
I'll come back to escort you home!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.130
I-I can't do that!

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.270
I'll go with you!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.720
Please let me go with you!

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:59.380
Huh? Okay...

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:38.100
It's starting to get dark.
We should call it a day and sleep.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:42.380
I-I'm grateful to hear that,
 but are we sleeping right here?

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:46.190
If we sleep right here,
 we'll be attacked by wild animals.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:48.510
Huh?! Then what are we going to do?!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.270
We'll sleep there.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.140
Huh?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.420
This is more comfortable than I thought.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.660
It is, isn't it?

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:01.710
I call them sleeping bag buds.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:05.650
I start to feel sleepy the moment 
I climb into one of these.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.160
What survival knowledge!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.410
That's my impressive Fai-san,
 companion of my dear Hero!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:15.540
Princess, do you love Yu-chan?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.020
Huh?! How did you know?!

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.750
Well, you just said she was dear to you.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:23.540
So now you know... Oh, dear.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:26.110
But she's such a wonderful person,

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.800
so it's only natural to admire her.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:33.060
She's gallant, strong, reliable, 
and occasionally wild.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:37.690
And yet she's still kind enough to 
escort me. She's so wonderful!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.190
Who's that?

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.660
Who? The Hero, of course.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.610
You sure say some strange things.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.590
Her ambition is higher than mountains,

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:50.200
her kindness as vast as the sky, and her—Oh?

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.760
She fell asleep.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.440
I was just getting to the good parts, too.

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.290
We're here!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.800
Welcome to Andas Village.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.210
Those participating in the 
Andas Melon-Eating Competition,

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.390
please apply over here!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:11.300
There it is!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.600
I came here to participate in that!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.810
I see.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.720
So this was the destination 
for your trip into the wild.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.310
I happened to visit here on 
my trip into the wild last year.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:24.440
I won first place and earned a 
year's supply of Andas melons!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.950
So I thought I'd come again this year!

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.180
I love them!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:30.820
When you bite into them, 
red bean paste comes out!

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.430
Is that so?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.850
I'm gonna win them again 
this year! Sign me up!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.880
Here, please!

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.780
Oh, you came again this year?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:43.320
I did! And I'm gonna win again!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:46.100
You really do love Andas melons.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.960
Oh, but will you be okay?

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.420
Why?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.820
They're trying something new this year.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.920
Everyone's competing in pairs.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.540
Huh? Really?!

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.730
Hey, Princess, pair up with me!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.040
Huh?!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:05.730
The preliminary round of the Andas 
Melon-Eating Competition will now begin!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:09.520
If you can finish ten melons 
within ten minutes,

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.240
you win the preliminary round!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:13.190
Ten in ten minutes?!

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.750
Don't worry, Princess.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.730
You don't need to force yourself.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:19.500
Looks like last year's champ 
is feeling pretty confident.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:23.500
But how long will that last?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.220
Oh, you're the ones who placed 
second and third last year.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.640
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:30.120
Until then, we'd finished first 
and second five years in a row.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:34.200
We're the Macho Brothers!
 How dare you knock us down a peg?!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.600
But this year, it's a pair competition.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.050
Too bad for you!

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.140
We're going to win it this year!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.640
Well, we're not going to lose, either!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.340
Everyone, are you ready?

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.520
Then, begin!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.680
Time to dig in!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.110
Thanks for the food!

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:04.790
Huh?!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.970
Yay!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:10.420
The Fai and Rona pair have 
passed the preliminary round!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:15.180
Now it's time for the Andas 
Melon-Eating Competition finals!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.570
Eating ten in ten minutes 
must have been a high bar,

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:21.180
as three pairs ran out of time and failed!

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:25.840
So this year, we have two pairs 
advancing to the finals!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.440
Fai-sama, I...

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:30.440
Huh?

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.270
Fai-sama, your stomach!

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:37.500
Ah... Well, I suppose ten whole 
melons filled me up a bit.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.450
But I can still keep going.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:44.060
You pulled ahead of us last round, 
but we won't lose in the finals!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.780
We're much better at this next one, after all!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:47.760
This next one?

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:50.700
For the finals, the pairs will compete to see

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:54.470
who can eat the most freshly picked 
Andas melons within 30 minutes!

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:55.970
Freshly picked?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.970
Huh?!

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.170
These are moving!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:07.720
This is Andas Village's special dish:
 Andas melons served live!

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:08.800
Huh?!

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.230
Don't worry!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.050
I'm good at this stuff, too!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.800
Now then, are both teams ready?

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:20.990
Let the Andas Melon-Eating
 Competition finals begin!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.750
Time to dig in!

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.900
Hold on! Wait! Please stay still!

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:30.960
An...

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.430
...das!

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:41.160
Fai and Rona are at the top, 
with ten already cleared!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.720
The Macho brothers are in 
second place with seven!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.980
Seriously?!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.230
What speed!

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:51.060
I can't do this!

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:53.980
Now, the finals are reaching their climax!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.240
There are only two minutes left!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.740
Fai and Rona remain in the lead with 29!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:03.420
The Macho Brothers are putting up a 
good fight as well, with 20 of their own,

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.560
but it doesn't look like 
they're catching up!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.120
Damn it! Are we going to lose again?!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:12.090
Her partner hasn't even 
eaten a single one, either!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.920
I'm sorry!

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.810
Wh-What's the matter, Fai-sama?

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:20.600
I think I've finally hit my limit.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.190
Fai-sama?!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:24.920
What's this?! Competitor Fai is down!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.430
Now, brother!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.980
Yes, brother!

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:29.980
Yes, yes!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:33.680
The Macho brothers are at 23 and catching up!

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.070
Twenty-four!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.380
Twenty-five!

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.460
There's little time left now!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:40.790
Fai-sama!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.530
I guess we're going to lose.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:46.030
Fai-sama...

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.020
No! Not yet!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.250
The Macho Brothers are at 28.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.140
Only more to tie!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.660
Time for the last spurt!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.960
Yeah!

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:09.810
They're finally tied at 29!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.970
The Macho Brothers have caught up!

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.250
Only one to go!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.060
Oh, hold on!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.320
Rona's just eaten the 30th one!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:23.640
And now, time's up!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:28.250
The winners of the Andas Melon-Eating 
Competition are Fai and Rona!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.860
You did great!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.560
That was incredible!

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.210
You worked hard!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.930
Princess!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.600
We did it!

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:49.280
We won this together, so let's 
split them up when we get home.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.340
No, I'll be fine.

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:52.980
Huh?

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.980
I'm actually not that fond of Andas melons.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:57.940
What?!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.300
But you still participated?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.490
Thank you!

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:09.600
You worked so hard for me, Princess!

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:10.800
Thank you!

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:14.120
Huh?

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:19.010
<i>Why am I feeling so happy?</i>

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:21.260
Hey!

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.380
Fai-chan, Rona-chan, welcome back!

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:26.840
We're home, everyone!

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.990
Hey, hey, listen to this!

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:31.600
The Princess was incredible!

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:39.360
She was all "ah-ah," then "zoom," and "sploosh,"
 and "hop hop," and "nom nom nom"!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.230
W-Wow...

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:46.610
But Princess, you really are incredible,
 to keep up with Fai's wild trip.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:49.990
Her trips are so crazy that 
even we have to turn her down.

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:52.120
That's incredible, Rona-chan!

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:54.360
No, it wasn't...

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:56.800
It was a fun trip, wasn't it, Princess?

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:00.670
Yes!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
My Yusha-sama!

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:38.330
"My Yusha-sama!"
